{"c":[{"name":"20261022T230859Z-f3b33970b7939cf9","text":"Engine suite has inverse torch skips: test_doctor_cli.py:54 skips when torch is installed, test_doctor.py:205 when torch is already loaded in the worker. Skip counts do not prove torch-gated tests ran; use pytest -rs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001340Z-97dfabc9146bc1fb","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: USING COMPRESSION zstd raises BinderException on v1.0.0 and v1.1.0 files, works from v1.2.0; in-memory accepts it (stores Uncompressed). No ALTER sets compression. v2.1.2's schema-0 leftover is a bare 12,288-byte file, no tables.","type":"note"}]}
